@POST http://localhost:5279/api/dev/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voyageCapacity": 2
}

### Confirm booking A (replace ids from seed)
@bookingAId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@idempotencyKey = 665886cf-e957-4555-b4ca-ad7b6baab8e5
@correlationId = f1382b1c-4525-4fd5-87cc-90803693a898

POST http://localhost:5279/api/bookings/{{bookingAId}}/confirm
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": null
}

### Replay the same confirmation (idempotent)
POST http://localhost:5279/api/bookings/{{bookingAId}}/confirm
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-ID: {{correlationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Payload conflict: same key, different booking
@bookingBId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
POST http://localhost:5279/api/bookings/{{bookingBId}}/confirm
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Get booking
GET http://localhost:5279/api/bookings/{{bookingAId}}

### Process outbox (after setting Outbox:SimulatePublishFailure)
POST http://localhost:5279/api/dev/outbox/process

### Health
GET http://localhost:5279/health
